-- title:
--   Order of a pulled-back differential at a tame place
-- statement:
--   Let $K$ be a perfect field and let $F$ and $F'$ be fields equipped with $K$-algebra structures. Assume there is an element $x_0 \in F$ such that $F$ is algebraic over the intermediate field $K(x_0)$ generated by $x_0$, and an element $x \in F'$ such that $F'$ is finite-dimensional over $K(x)$. Let $\varphi : F \to F'$ be a $K$-algebra homomorphism whose underlying ring homomorphism is integral, and let $w'$ be a place of $F'$ over $K$, that is, a valuation subring of $F'$ containing the image of $K$, different from $F'$ itself, and whose ideals are all principal. Write $e =$ `Place.ramificationIndexAlong φ w'` for the least positive integer $n$ that occurs as $\mathrm{ord}_{w'}(\varphi(f))$ for some nonzero $f \in F$, where $F$ is viewed as acting on $F'$ through $\varphi$, and write $w =$ `w'.restrictAlong φ hφ` for the place of $F$ whose valuation subring is the preimage of that of $w'$ under $\varphi$. Let $\omega \in \Omega_{F/K}$ be a nonzero differential, and assume that the image of $e$ in $K$ is nonzero, i.e. that $w'$ is tame. Then $$\mathrm{ord}_{w'}\bigl(\varphi^{*}\omega\bigr) = e\cdot \mathrm{ord}_{w}(\omega) + (e-1)$$ as an equality in $\mathbb{Z}$, where $\varphi^{*}$ is the $K$-linear map $\Omega_{F/K} \to \Omega_{F'/K}$ induced by $\varphi$, and where for a place $v$ the quantity $\mathrm{ord}_v(\eta)$ is defined as $v.\mathrm{ord}$ of the coefficient $g$ in the representation $\eta = g\, \mathrm{d}t$ with $t$ a chosen element of valuation $1$ at $v$.
--
--   This is the tame case of the local comparison of differentials under a finite map of one-variable function fields, the local ingredient of the Riemann–Hurwitz formula and of Dedekind's different theorem. It is used in the computations of orders of differentials on modular curves, in particular for the differential of the $q$-expansion of $j$ and for the order of the Hecke multiplier.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AlgebraicCurve_Place_ordDiff_pullbackDiff_of_natCast_ramificationIndexAlong_ne_zero.lean

import Definitions.Def_AlgebraicCurve_Correspondence
